  <h2>AI Prompts Privacy Policy</h2>

  <p class="intro">
    This privacy policy applies to the mobile application
    <strong>AI Prompts</strong> (package name:
    <code>com.ai.image.prompt.generator.finder</code>), published by
    Epic Lotus Games (hereby referred to as &quot;Service Provider&quot;), as a
    free service. The application is intended for use &quot;AS IS&quot;.
  </p>

  <h2>Information Collection and Use</h2>

  <p>
    The Application collects certain information automatically when you download
    and use it. This information may include:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Your device&apos;s Internet Protocol address (e.g. IP address)</li>
    <li>App screens and features you use, the time and date of your visit, and the time spent in the Application</li>
    <li>The operating system and general device information on your mobile device</li>
    <li>Advertising identifiers (such as the Android Advertising ID) used to deliver and measure ads</li>
    <li>App usage and analytics events (for example, ad load, impression, and performance events)</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Prompt Catalog</h3>
  <p>
    The Application downloads a catalog of AI image-generation prompts from
    Firebase Firestore. This content includes prompt text, example image URLs,
    and category tags. The Application <strong>reads this catalog only</strong>;
    you do not upload prompts or images to our servers through the Application.
  </p>

  <h3>Saved Prompts and Preferences</h3>
  <p>
    When you save a favorite prompt, the Application stores a copy locally on
    your device. The Application also stores small preferences locally (for
    example, saved prompts, theme mode, and in-app review prompt state) to
    improve your experience. This information is not transmitted to our servers.
  </p>

  <h3>Clipboard</h3>
  <p>
    When you copy a prompt, the text is placed on your device&apos;s clipboard.
    The Service Provider does not receive or store clipboard contents.
  </p>

  <h3>External AI Tools</h3>
  <p>
    The Application can open third-party AI tools such as ChatGPT or Google
    Gemini (native apps or websites) so you can use prompts to generate images.
    When you choose to open an external tool, you leave the Application and
    any data you provide in that tool is governed by the third party&apos;s own
    privacy policy.
  </p>

  <h3>Device Permissions</h3>
  <p>The Application may request the following permissions:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Internet</strong> — to download the prompt catalog, display advertisements, and send analytics events</li>
    <li><strong>Vibrate</strong> — for optional haptic feedback during interactions</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    You can deny permissions in your device settings. Some features may not work
    without the relevant permission.
  </p>

  <h3>Accounts and Personal Information</h3>
  <p>
    The Application does not require you to create an account. We do not ask you
    to provide your name, email address, phone number, or other personally
    identifiable information to use the core features of the Application.
  </p>

  <h3>Location</h3>
  <p>
    The Application does <strong>not</strong> collect, store, or use your
    device&apos;s location.
  </p>

  <h2>Third Party Access</h2>

  <p>
    The Service Provider uses third-party services to host the prompt catalog,
    display advertisements, measure app performance, and understand how the
    Application is used. These providers may collect and process data under
    their own privacy policies.
  </p>
  <p>
    Please note that the Application utilizes third-party services that have their
    own Privacy Policy about handling data. Below are links to the Privacy Policy
    of the third-party service providers used by the Application:
  </p>
  <ul>
